= Rosa Luxemburg

The party's leading theorist and the author of its programme. She believes the revolution must be the conscious work of the majority of the working class, not of a putsch, and she distrusts the Bolsheviks' methods even as she defends their revolution.

[? if year = 1919 and month <= 2 : She lost the vote on the election boycott at the founding congress, and has not stopped arguing since. ?]

- @persuade
- @against_putsch
