@persuade
title: Win the Argument
subtitle: Every district moves closer to the Zentrale.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer = 1 : Next advisor action in 1 month. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 1 : Next advisor action in [+ advisor_action_timer +] months. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 4;
Q.last_advisor_action = 1;
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    Q['district_' + d + '_loyalty'] += 8;
}
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 2;
Q.luxemburgist_satisfaction += 4;
!}

Luxemburg speaks and writes without rest. Even her opponents in the districts read her, and some of them change their minds.

@against_putsch
title: Against Putschism
subtitle: Cools the streets and the police. The Left Radicals are offended.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer = 1 : Next advisor action in 1 month. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 1 : Next advisor action in [+ advisor_action_timer +] months. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 4; last_advisor_action = 1; militancy -= 10; repression -= 5; ultraleft_satisfaction -= 8; offensive_satisfaction -= 4; luxemburgist_satisfaction += 5; lean_luxemburgist += 1

A revolution cannot be ordered from above, Luxemburg writes in Die Rote Fahne. It must grow out of the masses, or it will be drowned in blood.
